  "contract": [
    "Null canonical context returns7. Capture descriptor from initial context+12; subsequent context uses reload the shared pointer. Increment frame count with32-bit wrap.",
    "Clear28-byte assembly scratch and allocate channel_count*24 with32-bit wrap. Assembly error leaks that scratch as stock does; batch always frees it. Their errors call failure encoding then return original status. Aggregation errors return directly.",
    "On successful aggregation compute unsigned elapsed count/25, prepare spectral/ratio state, allocate channel_count*44 summary and two4-byte buffers. Preserve inference status while processing output. Later allocate4-byte and1-byte buffers and release five buffers in native order.",
    "Calibration loop runs once. Descriptor flag exactly1 enables threshold comparison, which uses unsigned32-to-float32 conversion and signaling VCMPE semantics. Raw-bit wrapped bounds are preserved. Metric modulo conversions truncate toward zero and saturate, including invalid/inexact/input-denormal status, through defined integer decoding and ARM status intrinsics. No undefined float-to-int cast or inline assembly is introduced.",
    "Execute the already verified actual C/native polynomial. Calibration uses distinct strict/inclusive bit bounds and mutually exclusive adjustments. Full active FPSCR, public RAM at boundaries, call order, typed local scratch, allocation sizes, saved registers, stack/masks and return status agree."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "Fourteen processing stages and allocation/free/clear ports are modeled. This admits core control flow, not a complete sensor computation engine, actual allocator lifecycle, inference executor or hardware sampling. Native/C polynomial bodies are real.",
    "1821 paired cases cover all682 native instruction bytes and all active rounding/FZ/DN combinations. Cases include signaling/quiet NaNs, saturation metrics, wrapped counts/sizes, callback context/status changes and error timing. Physical concurrency, allocation failures, arbitrary private aliases, cold FPU and final startup/placement remain unverified. The assembler reads a12-byte enable prefix extending into PPG storage; the modeled ports do not establish that frame-producer layout.",
    "The separately pinned20832-case instruction replay checks the defined C conversion primitive against the exact observed VCVT opcode. It is controlled instruction replay, not an additional stock function admission.",
    "An exploratory NaN-invalid mutation was unobservable because the preceding VCMPE already set IOC. It is retained and excluded from the twelve rejected controls; the final invalid-flag control tests finite overflow instead.",
    "901 units compile/compose without failures or duplicate strong symbols;890 prior nongenerated source/object pairs and source-plan/cache files are unchanged. One aggregate import becomes14 explicit unfinished stages, increasing application imports78 to91; boot imports stay22. Relocatable composition is not a bootable image."
  ],
